in=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/untitled-1561.5x-870x480.webp\" alt=\"The Seer of Truths\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Easy and simple</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The Wealth Signal™ is a neuroscience-inspired digital program designed to support a healthier relationship with money and long-term financial growth. Rather than relying on complex systems or aggressive techniques, it introduces a simple 9-word wealth script intended to help shift subconscious thought patterns and encourage a more abundance-focused mindset.<br><br>The program is built around the idea that calm, focused mental states—often associated with Alpha brainwave activity—can help improve clarity, awareness, and decision-making. By practicing this short daily routine for just a few minutes, users are guided to become more intentional, reflective, and open to recognizing practical opportunities in everyday life.<br><br>Unlike generic motivation tips or surface-level affirmations, The Wealth Signal™ emphasizes consistency and self-awareness. The goal is not instant results, but gradual improvement in habits, confidence, and financial thinking that can support smarter choices over time. Its short, easy-to-follow format makes it suitable for beginners, busy professionals, and anyone seeking a structured yet gentle mindset routine.<br><br>Encourages a positive and disciplined money mindset<br><br>Supports calm focus and intentional action through mental training<br><br>Helps users become more aware of opportunities and possibilities<br><br>Simple daily routine designed for long-term consistency<br><br>The Wealth Signal™ is a digital self-development experience created to complement personal effort, financial education, and goal-setting—helping users move toward greater clarity and financial confidence at their own pace.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"https://thewelthsignal.com/order\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-cart-add mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Get The Wealth Signal™</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
