pe !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ws-headphone-470x556.png\" alt=\"The Seer of Truths\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style pt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                    Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Image with Description</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">The Wealth Signal™ is a digital audio-based self-development program designed to support a healthier money mindset and improved mental focus. It introduces a short daily listening routine combined with a simple nine-word script intended to encourage calm awareness, reflection, and more intentional thinking around finances and personal goals.<br><br>The program is built around the concept that relaxed, attentive mental states—often associated with Alpha brainwave activity—can help reduce mental overload and improve clarity. By practicing the routine consistently, users are guided to feel less stressed, more focused, and better equipped to approach decisions with patience and perspective.<br><br>Rather than relying on complex financial systems or aggressive motivational tactics, The Wealth Signal™ emphasizes simplicity and consistency. The goal is to support gradual mindset shifts that may help users become more organized, more confident, and more aware of opportunities they may have previously overlooked.<br><br>In addition to its focus on financial awareness, the program highlights overall mental and emotional balance. By encouraging relaxation and structured reflection, it aims to complement existing personal development efforts, productivity habits, and goal-setting practices.<br><br>The Wealth Signal™ is designed for individuals from many backgrounds—including professionals, entrepreneurs, and those seeking personal clarity—who want an easy-to-follow daily routine that fits into a busy lifestyle. It is intended as a supportive digital experience, not a replacement for financial education or professional advice.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
