<div><b>Supporting Conscious and Subconscious Awareness</b></div><div>By combining relaxation with repetition, the routine aims to encourage awareness of long-held beliefs and habits around money. Over time, this reflective process may help users recognize unhelpful patterns and replace them with more constructive perspectives that support consistency and confidence.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Using the Nine-Word Script</b></div><div>The nine-word script is a simple focal point within the program. Listening to or repeating it regularly provides structure and consistency, making the routine accessible for beginners and practical for professionals. It can be used in the morning, evening, or whenever a brief reset is helpful.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Emphasizing Consistency Over Complexity</b></div><div>The Wealth Signal™ is designed to feel manageable rather than overwhelming. With steady use, users may notice improved organization, clearer priorities, and a more intentional approach to financial habits and opportunities. The program is intended to complement personal effort, financial education, and goal-setting—not replace them.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
