          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b7b3ef\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">The Wealth Signal™ is designed as a simple daily mindset routine. While results vary from person to person, the following practices can help users engage with the program more intentionally and consistently.</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ol>\n            <li><b>Create a Focused Environment :</b>&nbsp;When listening to the audio or using the script, choose a quiet, comfortable space where interruptions are limited. A calm setting can make it easier to relax, stay attentive, and fully engage with the experience.</li>\n            <li><b>Practice Mental Visualization :</b>&nbsp;Some users find it helpful to reflect on their personal goals while using the program. Visualizing positive outcomes—such as improved organization, confidence, or clarity—can support motivation and reinforce intentional thinking.</li>\n            <li><b>Use Supportive Self-Talk :</b>&nbsp;Incorporating constructive, realistic self-statements into daily life may help reinforce a healthier mindset around money and personal growth. The emphasis should be on encouragement and consistency rather than unrealistic expectations.</li>\n            <li><b>Maintain Healthy Daily Habits :</b>&nbsp;Overall well-being plays a role in mental clarity and focus. Adequate sleep, balanced nutrition, regular movement, and stress management can support cognitive performance and complement any personal development routine.</li>\n            <li><b>Practice Gratitude and Reflection :</b>&nbsp;Taking time to acknowledge progress, effort, and existing resources can help foster a balanced perspective. Gratitude practices may support emotional stability and reinforce positive habits over time.</li><li><b>Combine with Practical Guidance :</b>&nbsp;The Wealth Signal™ is intended to complement—not replace—financial education, professional advice, or structured planning. Learning from qualified professionals can help align mindset work with real-world action.</li><li><b>Stay Consistent :</b>&nbsp;Like most routines, consistency matters. Using the program regularly as part of a daily schedule may help reinforce focus, awareness, and long-term habit formation.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
