          "_name": "article11",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article11\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n       <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">        \n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-0 mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Nitric Boost Ultra™ | Official Site</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">The Wealth Signal™ is designed around principles commonly discussed in neuroscience and psychology, particularly the role of mental states in focus, clarity, and habit formation. Rather than complex techniques, it uses a short, repeatable routine intended to encourage calm awareness and intentional thinking around money and personal goals.<div><br></div><div><b>Understanding Brainwave States</b></div><div>The brain naturally moves through different electrical activity patterns, often referred to as brainwaves. Two commonly discussed states are Beta, which is associated with active thinking and stress, and Alpha, which is linked to relaxed focus and creativity. Mental state matters because excessive stress can interfere with clear thinking, reflection, and consistent decision-making.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Why Reducing Mental Overload Matters</b></div><div>When the mind is constantly in a high-alert state, it can become difficult to reflect, plan, or change ingrained habits. Encouraging relaxation may help reduce mental noise, making it easier to observe thoughts, question patterns, and respond more intentionally rather than reactively.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Encouraging a Calm, Focused State</b></div><div>The audio guidance and short script used in The Wealth Signal™ are designed to support a relaxed yet attentive mindset often associated with Alpha activity. In this state, users may find it easier to focus, think creatively, and reflect on goals without pressure or distraction.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Supporting Awareness and Better Choices</b></div><div>A calmer mental state can improve openness to new ideas, pattern recognition, and follow-through on plans. Over time, this awareness may help users notice practical opportunities, organize priorities, and make more thoughtful financial and personal decisions.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Science-Inspired and Habit-Friendly</b></div><div>Research suggests that relaxation-based mental training can support focus, emotional balance, and creativity. While individual experiences vary and no program can promise financial outcomes, a brief daily routine can help create a supportive mental environment for confidence, consistency, and long-term habit development.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
