          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b7b3ef\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">The Wealth Signal™ is designed as a mindset-focused digital routine that supports clarity, consistency, and a more intentional approach to money and personal goals. While individual experiences may vary, users may notice the following potential benefits over time:</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ol>\n            <li><b>Supports a Healthier Money Mindset :</b>&nbsp;By encouraging calm reflection and focused attention, the program may help users approach financial goals with greater patience and confidence. This mindset-oriented approach emphasizes awareness and consistency rather than shortcuts or pressure.</li>\n            <li><b>Improved Mental Clarity and Focus :</b>&nbsp;The short daily routine is intended to help reduce mental distraction and improve focus. A clearer mental state can support better planning, prioritization, and more thoughtful decision-making in everyday financial situations.</li>\n            <li><b>Encourages Relaxation and Emotional Balance :</b>&nbsp;The guided audio experience promotes a calmer mental environment, which may help reduce stress and emotional overwhelm. Feeling more balanced can support resilience and steadier responses to financial challenges.</li>\n            <li><b>Simple and Easy to Maintain :</b>&nbsp;The Wealth Signal™ is designed to fit into busy schedules. Its brief, flexible format makes it accessible for beginners and practical for experienced users who want a consistent daily routine without complexity.</li>\n            <li><b>Motivation Through Shared Learning :</b>&nbsp;Some users appreciate the sense of motivation that comes from engaging with a broader community or shared learning environment. This can encourage accountability, idea-sharing, and continued commitment to personal goals.</li><li><b>Science-Inspired, Not Overstated :</b>&nbsp;The program draws inspiration from widely discussed concepts related to relaxation, focus, and habit formation. While no method can guarantee financial results, these principles are commonly associated with improved cognitive clarity and emotional regulation.</li><li><b>Encourages Long-Term Growth :</b>&nbsp;Rather than focusing on quick outcomes, The Wealth Signal™ emphasizes gradual improvement. Over time, this structured approach may help users build stronger habits, greater confidence, and a more balanced perspective on financial growth.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
